# SAT plan layout lock

**Default: content only.** Never change quiz layout unless the user explicitly asks to change layout/spacing/shell/CSS.

## Step screens (`sat-plan-*.tsx`, except landing/funnel/chapter-stub)

- Use **`QuizStepTemplate`** only — do not import `FunnelShell` or `FunnelCta`.
- Swap **`headline`**, **`hint`**, **`bodyVariant`**, and body children only.
- **`bodyVariant`**: `tile-grid` | `option-list` | `copy` — no custom `bodyClassName`.
- No custom **`footer`**, no inline layout styles, no new spacing margins on step files.

## Locked files (require `FUNNEL_LAYOUT_UNLOCK=1` + owner approval)

- `app/satplan/funnel.css`
- `components/sat-plan/funnel-shell.tsx`
- `components/sat-plan/quiz-step-template.tsx`
- `components/sat-plan/funnel-cta.tsx`
- `lib/sat-plan-funnel/quiz-step-layout.ts`

Read `components/sat-plan/LAYOUT.lock.md` before any satplan UI work.

Verification: `npm run funnel:layout-guard` (included in `npm run agent:verify`).
